05 — PREFLIGHT ENGINE
==================================================

The Preflight Engine determines whether the experiment is technically ready to be shown to the human signer.

PREFLIGHT RESULT

PASS

WARNING

BLOCK

A PASS means:

the known technical requirements are satisfied.

It does not mean:

the transaction is financially advisable.

A WARNING means:

the experiment may proceed only if the human explicitly reviews the condition.

A BLOCK means:

no live payload should be released until the problem is resolved.

