==================================================
EVIDENCE FIRST
==================================================

The factory is not optimized around:

HOW MANY TOKENS CAN WE LAUNCH?

It is optimized around:

HOW MANY EXPERIMENTS CAN WE REPRODUCE?

A valid experiment can produce:

positive findings

negative findings

unexpected findings

or

no meaningful activity.

All are retained.

==================================================
FACTORY SAFETY BOUNDARY
==================================================

Do not build an automated loop whose objective is:

LAUNCH
→ WAIT FOR TRADERS
→ EXTRACT FEES
→ LAUNCH AGAIN
→ REPEAT

without fresh research justification and human authorization.

The system instead requires:

QUESTION
→ HYPOTHESIS
→ EXPERIMENT
→ OBSERVATION
→ REVIEW
→ NEXT HUMAN DECISION

This keeps PONS $101 functioning as a research laboratory rather than a transaction-spam engine.

==================================================
PUBLIC-GOOD INTEGRATION
==================================================

Where creator fees are legitimately received:

ROB measures protocol activity.

A treasury observer independently verifies receipts.

The system then records:

FEE OBSERVED

CREATOR ENTITLEMENT

